[issue_comment] jaxxzer | created=2020-01-06T19:26:21Z | updated=2020-01-06T19:26:21Z | https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/pull/12519#issuecomment-571276755
@Williangalvani

body:
This PR copies ATC_RAT_RLL/PIT_FILT to ATC_RAT_RLL/PIT_FLTT as part of the parameter conversion code.

This should resolve a "shaky copter" issue reported during pre-4.0 testing which is related to the split of the single ATC_RAT_RLL/PIT/YAW_FILT parameter into three separate filters (_FLTT, _FLTE, FLTD).

Screen shots below are from SITL testing to confirm the FILT parameter is being correctly converted.
![before-after](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1498098/67454292-a8c29e00-f664-11e9-8cbe-f62730911eb0.png)

@lthall, @andyp1per, can you confirm you're happy with this?
@bnsgeyer, this does not affect traditional helicopters so just FYI.

